{"documents": [{"evidence_id": "aab29bad-1c14-5c99-8d15-745fb28791eb", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "在 STM32F407 上完成外设初始化：先使能 RCC 时钟，再配置 GPIO 复用功能，最后设置外设寄存器。", "title": "stm32/evidence_0.md", "topic": "stm32"}, {"evidence_id": "04a4f501-f2d6-53fd-8469-5f64925fc43c", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "STM32 的启动流程从复位向量开始，经过 SystemInit 后进入 main，时钟树在进入 main 前完成配置。", "title": "stm32/evidence_1.md", "topic": "stm32"}, {"evidence_id": "6c00c68d-61a1-5299-a941-3b2366f4bd12", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "基于 FreeRTOS 实现多任务实时控制：使用 vTaskDelayUntil 保证周期任务的节拍稳定，任务间通过队列通信。", "title": "freertos/evidence_0.md", "topic": "freertos"}, {"evidence_id": "cd84c0b9-e8ce-5318-8140-e8ac5d48de49", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "FreeRTOS 中任务与中断服务程序之间使用队列传递数据，共享资源由互斥量保护以避免优先级反转。", "title": "freertos/evidence_1.md", "topic": "freertos"}, {"evidence_id": "dd791653-d247-5352-91e8-89860ec5c7d4", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "通过编码器读取转速，使用 PID 控制器计算占空比输出到电机驱动，积分项做了抗饱和处理。", "title": "pid/evidence_0.md", "topic": "pid"}, {"evidence_id": "256f145d-b1f8-54ef-8f19-5608e16d409a", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "整定 PID 参数时先调比例再调积分，阶跃响应出现过冲说明比例增益偏大。", "title": "pid/evidence_1.md", "topic": "pid"}, {"evidence_id": "df6cf237-69b6-5e29-a66e-7eaae400a9f3", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "实现 CANopen 协议栈的节点管理与错误帧处理，总线仲裁采用非破坏性逐位仲裁机制。", "title": "can/evidence_0.md", "topic": "can"}, {"evidence_id": "0842dd08-c5a2-52af-bdb4-5ffc8860f7bf", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "CAN 总线出现大量错误帧时，先检查终端电阻与波特率配置，再逐节点断开定位。", "title": "can/evidence_1.md", "topic": "can"}, {"evidence_id": "cb06ec8c-a9b8-5c64-b745-f84d2830c259", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "使用 UART DMA 配合空闲中断与环形缓冲区接收不定长数据帧，接收过程不占用 CPU 轮询。", "title": "uart_dma/evidence_0.md", "topic": "uart_dma"}, {"evidence_id": "3e538d0d-525a-55b5-ab85-eb1b7d2ba3e2", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "UART 波特率不匹配时会出现持续乱码，接收偶发丢字节需要检查 DMA 缓冲长度与中断优先级。", "title": "uart_dma/evidence_1.md", "topic": "uart_dma"}, {"evidence_id": "2a6eaeed-b1e9-5ad1-921a-75dce77d30cd", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "使用 pgvector 存储证据向量，查询时按余弦相似度检索 Top-K 片段，索引采用 HNSW。", "title": "pgvector/evidence_0.md", "topic": "pgvector"}, {"evidence_id": "23db8d45-5e4e-542d-9466-33876abaced9", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "pgvector 的 HNSW 索引参数 m 与 ef_construction 决定了召回率与构建时间的权衡。", "title": "pgvector/evidence_1.md", "topic": "pgvector"}, {"evidence_id": "680ffd1c-7065-523e-8165-ce35336ba427", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "混合检索将关键词检索与语义检索的结果用 RRF 融合，避免不同通道的分数不可比问题。", "title": "rag_rrf/evidence_0.md", "topic": "rag_rrf"}, {"evidence_id": "c25462f2-9e0d-540f-8cb4-323f086a8ff7", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "RAG 链路中先分块再嵌入，检索命中后把片段与元数据一起交给生成模型。", "title": "rag_rrf/evidence_1.md", "topic": "rag_rrf"}, {"evidence_id": "dd811968-a2c5-5389-8fcf-3968569963a9", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "使用 Docker Compose 编排服务与数据库，通过 healthcheck 控制启动顺序，数据卷持久化。", "title": "docker/evidence_0.md", "topic": "docker"}, {"evidence_id": "b4b57f16-ba14-5c6e-a84c-2c35c5bdbaf9", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "多阶段构建把编译依赖留在构建阶段，运行镜像只保留产物，并以非 root 用户启动。", "title": "docker/evidence_1.md", "topic": "docker"}, {"evidence_id": "5ee877c1-18f2-552a-a496-e2ea7c67ddce", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "Next.js App Router 中服务端组件负责数据获取，客户端组件只用于需要交互的部分。", "title": "react_next/evidence_0.md", "topic": "react_next"}, {"evidence_id": "2521a9a2-4406-516a-9971-aeb6ba84ed87", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "深色主题在服务端注入 data-theme 属性，避免首屏闪烁与 hydration 不一致。", "title": "react_next/evidence_1.md", "topic": "react_next"}, {"evidence_id": "14992f58-8ec2-5dc4-9250-6909cf8cf96b", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "使用 pytest 编写单元测试与集成测试，集成测试通过 httpx 的 ASGI transport 直接调用应用。", "title": "pytest/evidence_0.md", "topic": "pytest"}, {"evidence_id": "13859aea-b66f-5a5b-881f-829c95f59ed7", "kind": "document_chunk", "text": "pytest 的 fixture 用于准备测试数据与数据库会话，参数化用例覆盖边界条件。", "title": "pytest/evidence_1.md", "topic": "pytest"}], "id": "retrieval-corpus", "queries": [{"gold_ids": ["aab29bad-1c14